(
/*
SCAFFOLDING - GWDM 2.2 does not exist in schemata-2 yet.

Direction: input GWDM 2.1 -> output GWDM 2.2 (the path is output-first).

Follows the delta-transform pattern of maps/GWDM/2.0/GWDM/2.1: spread the input
and override only what changed. Adds the accessibility.usage fields GWDM 2.2 is
expected to carry for HDRUK 4.1.0, sourced from `extra` since GWDM 2.1 has
nowhere to hold them.

This pair exists so GWDM 2.2 can reach the rest of the graph - CRUK and
SchemaOrg are only reachable via GWDM 2.1 and 2.0.

The assumed 2.2 shape, and everything still outstanding, is documented in
maps/GWDM/2.2/HDRUK/4.1.0/translation.jsonata.
*/
input ~> |$| {
  "accessibility": accessibility ~> |$| {
    "usage": usage ? usage ~> |$| {
      /* GWDM 2.2 PLACEHOLDER - assumed shape, confirm when the 2.2 schema lands. */
      "duoCodes": $exists($$.extra.duoCodes) ? $$.extra.duoCodes : null,
      "dataUsePermissions": $exists($$.extra.patientRecontact) ?
        { "patientRecontact": $$.extra.patientRecontact } : null
    }| : null
  }|
}|
)
